## 2. Art & Visual Style Bible
Sources (in priority order): `design/ART-BIBLE.md` (wins where it differs) → `art/v2/style-guide.md` (primary pipeline/sizes/naming) → `art/v2/palette.json|css`. `art/style-guide.md` (v1 flat vector) is **superseded — never use**.
- **Style:** dark fantasy oil painting, visible brushwork, dramatic chiaroscuro, "coastal gothic". No flat vector, cel shading or clean line art.
- **Shared prompt suffix (exact):** `dark fantasy oil painting, dramatic chiaroscuro, coastal gothic, muted desaturated palette, one glowing accent, highly detailed` (+ "no text, no border").
- **Value/colour:** low-key (~70% of image in 0–35% value); muted slate, verdigris, kelp green, wet iron, bone; saturation <~35% except **one glowing accent per image** (subject's class/enemy hue). Darkest darks cool blue-green (`#07080a`–`#10171d`), never large flat black.
- **Named colour families (never confuse):** Kelp green `#0f2e2a #2f6b4f #7fbf7a` (living things) · Moon teal `#3fb4b0 #9fe3d6` (Tidecaller, real moon) · Lure green `#b9d4a6/#7fa58a/#1f3a33/#d8d4c0` (Undermoon reflection — thin rings/threads/formless glow only) · Corona gold `#d9a53a #f2d17a #ffe9a8 #b8862b` (half-swallowed sun, from low/below horizon).
- **Lighting:** warm-neutral key from upper left; cool rim from upper right (`#9fb4c8`-ish); accent throws small local light. No flat front light, no bright full backgrounds.
- **Edges:** no drawn outline; cut-outs get a darkened 1–2 px edge + cool rim (`tools/cutout.py`), never a white/grey halo.
- **Materials / UI dressing:** painted bronze, brass, barnacle, mother-of-pearl, weathered stone, ornate weathered frames; painted gold buttons, bronze switches/sliders (v0.6.5–v0.6.6 work).
- **Character design:** heroes grim, weathered, practical clothing, hoods/masks welcome; never glamorous. Silhouette readable as solid black at 64 px. Heroes face **right**, enemies **left**. Duelist blade rule: right hand rapier (gold guard, round pommel, offence), left main-gauche (broad, blued, diamond pommel, defence).
- **Enemies:** wrong-shaped creatures of the drowned world (brine, rust, coral, bells, lanterns, fungus); one oversized feature, one glowing weak point.
- **Environment motifs:** the climb is always visible (sea lower, lighthouse closer); rain, spray, fog, motes, wet reflections (environment layer only); objects tell the lore, never labels; **the Undermoon is never drawn**.
- **Battle effects (Option A, shipped v0.6.5, `art/v2/fx/`):** teal wave Crest (`tide-crest`), blood-red crescent Flourish (`duel-flourish`), bronze bell with rune rings Echo (`echo-bell`), amber glyph ring Waypoint (`carto-waypoint`), barnacled bronze Guard shield that shatters (`guard-shield`, `guard-shatter`).
- **Avoid (Spencer):** emoji anywhere in UI · plain/basic/flat boxes, chips, text buttons · "i" info icons · ground ripple rings · code-drawn environment effects · flat/cut edges · effects that look pasted-on (must be painted and integrated) · text/letters/watermarks/borders inside generated art · copying existing games.
- **Art QA:** `tools/art-review.sh <img> "context"` (Gemini technical check + Claude style check) → `art-reviews/<name>.md`; ship only on PASS. Checked in-game on an S24 screenshot. Spencer's art approval gates shipping, not building. Art bar: `/workspace/studio/art-staging/README.md`.
